WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Step 1: Open zoom.us/profile/setting, Meeting tab. Meeting Passcode stays on: Zoom requires a passcode, a waiting room or sign-in on every meeting.

2
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Step 2: Embed passcode in invite link: on. The passcode rides inside each person's link, so nobody types it.

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Step 3: Only authenticated participants can join: off. Left on, Zoom turns away every registrant without a Zoom account.

4
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Step 4: Mute all participants when they join: on.

5
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Step 5: Co-host: on, so a teammate can run the room with you.

6
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Step 6: Focus Mode: on, with Allow host to enable focus mode when scheduling ticked. Attendees see only you.

7
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Step 7: Request permission to unmute: on. A greyed switch is locked for the account: change it at zoom.us/account/setting.

8
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Step 8: Recording tab: Cloud recording on, with Create audio transcript ticked further down.

9
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Step 9: Now the app. In the Zoom App Marketplace click the plus, Build app, and pick Server-to-Server OAuth.

10
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Step 10: On Scopes, add the twelve scopes listed on your card, exactly as written.

11
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:57.000
Step 11: Day 2: on Feature, turn on Event Subscriptions, paste the address the agent gives you, then Add Events.

12
00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:02.000
Step 12: Tick Recording, All Recordings have completed. The four Meeting events are optional live tracking.

13
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:06.000
Step 13: Copy the Secret Token on the Feature page into the optional field on your card.

14
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:11.000
Step 14: Activate the app, then copy the Account ID, Client ID and Client Secret from App Credentials.
